#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.normalize.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.normalize"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:1
msgid "Convert times to midnight."
msgstr "将时间转换为午夜。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:3
msgid ""
"The time component of the date-time is converted to midnight i.e. "
"00:00:00. This is useful in cases, when the time does not matter. Length "
"is unaltered. The timezones are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"日期时间的时间部分被转换为午夜，即 00:00:00。这在时间不重要的情况下很有用"
"。长度保持不变。时区不受影响。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:7
msgid ""
"This method is available on Series with datetime values under the ``.dt``"
" accessor, and directly on Datetime Array/Index."
msgstr ""
"此方法可用于具有 datetime 值的 Series 下的 ``.dt`` 访问器，以及直接用于 "
"Datetime Array/Index。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.normalize.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:10
msgid ""
"The same type as the original data. Series will have the same name and "
"index. DatetimeIndex will have the same name."
msgstr ""
"与原始数据相同的类型。Series 将具有相同的名称和索引。DatetimeIndex 将具有"
"相同的名称。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.normalize.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:16
msgid ":py:obj:`floor`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:17
msgid "Floor the datetimes to the specified freq."
msgstr "将 datetime 向下舍入到指定频率。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:19
msgid ":py:obj:`ceil`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:20
msgid "Ceil the datetimes to the specified freq."
msgstr "将 datetime 向上舍入到指定频率。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:22
msgid ":py:obj:`round`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimes.DatetimeArray.normalize:23
msgid "Round the datetimes to the specified freq."
msgstr "将 datetime 舍入到指定频率。"

